<title>USA: Access Health names Gardner CEO.</title>
<headline>Access Health names Gardner CEO.</headline>
<dateline>RANCHO CORDOVA, Calif. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Access Health Inc said it named its president and chief operating officer, Thomas Gardner, to the additional post of chief executive officer.</p>
<p>In his new post, he succeeds Kenneth Plumlee, who remains chairman.</p>
<p>Access said Gardner planned to focus on the company's medium- and long-term strategies, especially new business opportunities and partnerships.</p>
